================================================================================
                                   APPENDIX
               HOW TO APPLY THIS LICENSE TO YOUR REPOSITORY
================================================================================

To apply the STD Public License to your software or repository:

1. Place a file named `LICENSE` in the root of your project containing 
   this full text.

2. Attach this standard header notice at the top of each source file:

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) [YEAR] [YOUR NAME OR ORGANIZATION]

Licensed under the STD Public License (the "License"); you may not use 
this file except in compliance with the License. You may obtain a copy of 
the License at: https://github.com/STD-DEEPANSHU

Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software distributed 
under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR 
CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

3. Add the license badge in your README.md:

[![License: STD](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-STD%20Public%20License-red.svg)](LICENSE)

